@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

title System Sequence Diagram (SSD) - US03

autonumber

actor "Political Agent" as Agent
participant ":System" as System

activate Agent

Agent -> System : asks to list institutions
activate System
System --> Agent : displays all institutions grouped by type\nand sorted alphabetically by name within each group
deactivate System

deactivate Agent

@enduml
